{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7c3e2a1-5d84-4f16-9a2b-3c6e8f0d1a47",
    "name": "databaas-plus 流水线接口",
    "description": "databaas-plus 流水线平台接口集合（服务：http://47.111.109.8:28001）。\n\n导入后先改集合变量，再按 0.1 → 1.x → 2.1 → 3.x → 4.x → 5.x 的顺序点。\n\n变量说明：\n  base_url       http://47.111.109.8:28001（前端和 /api 反代的入口）\n  username       shardora\n  password_plain 明文密码，默认 test\n  password_md5   三层 MD5 后的值，前置脚本会按 password_plain 重算\n  access_token   0.1 登录后自动写入\n  pipeline_id    46（helloworld）\n  task_id        142（helloworld）\n  schedule_id    400（helloworld 最近一次运行的调度 id）\n  run_time       202409020000，查询类请求用它，对应上面那条已验证的历史记录\n  run_time_now   集合前置脚本按当前小时算，执行类请求用它\n\n四个必须知道的坑：\n1. 密码不是明文。前端提交前做 md5(md5(md5(明文)))，库里存的就是这个串。\n   shardora 的明文是 test，变换后是 25ab3b38f7afc116f18fa9821e44d561。\n2. 认证头是 Authorization: Bearer <token>，不是 JWT —— 虽然用的是 simplejwt，\n   但 AUTH_HEADER_TYPES 没改。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided.。\n3. 请求体格式是这套接口最大的坑：只有登录是 JSON，其余全是表单编码\n   （application/x-www-form-urlencoded）。发 JSON 会让视图里的 request.POST 全取到 None，\n   紧接着 int(None) 直接 500。集合里各请求的 body 模式已经把这件事固定住了，别改成 JSON。\n4. retry_count 有两套取值：接口侧 1..4，库里 0/1/5/-1。2.1 传接口值。\n\n带真实副作用的请求（会写库 / 会提交作业）：2.1、3.1、3.2、3.3、3.4、3.5、3.6。\n同目录 databaas_pipeline_client.py 是等价的 Python 实现，DATABAAS_PIPELINE_API.md 是文字版接口说明。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 鉴权",
      "description": "先跑这一组拿 token。集合里所有 /pipeline/* 请求都靠 {{access_token}}，而它由 0.1 的响应脚本自动写入。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 登录（换 access token）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/rest_token/",
            "description": "整个集合唯一的 JSON body 接口（DRF 的 TokenObtainPairView），其余接口一律表单编码。\n\npassword 必须是 md5(md5(md5(明文)))，不是明文——库里存的就是这个串。\n用例：用户 shardora，明文 test -> 25ab3b38f7afc116f18fa9821e44d561。\n（如果密码字面就是 \"shardora test\"，那个值换成 acaa980fe939b376a0b9645cfce36485。）\n\n返回 {\"access\": ..., \"refresh\": ...}，access 有效期 30 天、refresh 5 天。\n响应脚本会自动把 access 写进集合变量 access_token，后续请求不用手动粘。\n\nJS 里现算（集合前置脚本已内置，失败时回落到变量默认值）：\n  var h1 = CryptoJS.MD5(plain).toString();\n  var h2 = CryptoJS.MD5(h1).toString();\n  var h3 = CryptoJS.MD5(h2).toString();  // 这个才是要传的\nPython 等价写法：\n  import hashlib\n  h1 = hashlib.md5(text.encode()).hexdigest()\n  h2 = hashlib.md5(h1.encode()).hexdigest()\n  h3 = hashlib.md5(h2.encode()).hexdigest()  # 这个才是要传的",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_md5}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "function __store() {",
                  "    if (typeof pm !== 'undefined') {",
                  "        if (pm.collectionVariables) { return pm.collectionVariables; }",
                  "        if (pm.environmentVariables) { return pm.environmentVariables; }",
                  "        if (pm.globals) { return pm.globals; }",
                  "        if (typeof pm.environment !== 'undefined') { return pm.environment; }",
                  "    }",
                  "    return null;",
                  "}",
                  "function vGet(k) { var s = __store(); return s ? s.get(k) : undefined; }",
                  "function vSet(k, v) { var s = __store(); if (s) { s.set(k, v); } }",
                  "",
                  "// 登录成功后把 token 写进变量，后面所有请求直接用 {{access_token}}",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res && res.access) {",
                  "        vSet('access_token', res.access);",
                  "        if (res.refresh) { vSet('refresh_token', res.refresh); }",
                  "        console.log('access_token 已写入变量（有效期 30 天）');",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        console.log('响应里没有 access，检查用户名和密码哈希是否正确');",
                  "    }",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.log('响应不是 JSON，登录失败: ' + e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 查询",
      "description": "读接口：看有哪些流程、流程下有哪些任务、单个任务的原始参数。改参数前用 1.3 拿当前值。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 流程列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/get_pipelines/",
            "description": "返回全部流程：{\"status\":0, \"pipeline_list\":[{\"id\":46,\"name\":\"helloworld\"}, ...]}，实测 127 条。\n\n这个视图少写了 @permission_classes，带上 token 也行、不带也能读。\n集合里统一带了 Authorization，只是为了格式一致。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": []
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 流程下的任务和连线",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/get_tasks/",
            "description": "返回 task_list / edges / pipe_id / pipe_usr_graph。\n\n改参数前先看这个，能从 task_list 里拿到 config 原值和 prev_task_ids。\n注意 config 里是 \\r\\n 分隔的 key=value，回写时保持原格式。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "pipeline_id",
                  "value": "{{pipeline_id}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "流程 id，未知时先跑 1.1"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 任务详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/get_task_detail/{{task_id}}/",
            "description": "注意是 GET，task_id 在路径里，不是查询参数。\n\n返回里关键的两处：\n  task      —— 库里原始值，task.config 带 \\r\\n，回写要用这个\n  顶层 config —— 渲染后的展示串（\\n），只用来给人看\n\ntask 里没有 type，处理器类型字段叫 proc_type —— 这正是 2.1 要回填给 type 的值。\nretry_count 这里返回的是库里的值（0/1/5/-1），传给 2.1 之前要翻成接口值（1/2/3/4）。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 修改任务参数",
      "description": "改任务参数并保存。注意是写库操作，且是「全量表单」——未修改的字段也要带上当前值。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 改任务参数",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/update_task/{{task_id}}/",
            "description": "有真实副作用：直接写库。\n\n后台是 TaskForm(request.POST, instance=task) 的全量表单，缺字段会被判为无效，\n所以这里所有字段都列出来了——不想改的字段要保持当前值，不是留空。\n\n四个容易踩的点：\n1. retry_count 要传接口值：1=不重试 2=重试1次 3=重试5次 4=一直重试。\n   传库里的 5 会报 Select a valid choice. 5 is not one of the available choices.，服务端再映射回 0/1/5/-1。\n2. 字段名是 type，但值取自 proc_type（1=python 2=spark 3=oozie 4=odps 5=shell 6=docker 7=clickhouse 8=v100）。\n3. config 里 \\n 和 \\r\\n 都能收，存进去统一是 \\r\\n。\n4. 请求体必须是表单编码。发 JSON 时所有字段都取到 None，紧接着 int(None) 直接 500。\n\n返回 {\"status\":0,\"msg\":\"OK\"} 即成功；status=1 时 msg 是表单校验错误文本。\n下面这份默认值抄自 pipeline 46 / task 142（helloworld），可直接发送。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "helloworld",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "必填，任务名"
                },
                {
                  "key": "config",
                  "value": "pod_name=helloworld-1723\nimage_name=hello-world",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "任务参数，key=value 换行分隔。改参数就是改这里"
                },
                {
                  "key": "template",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "脚本模板，可空"
                },
                {
                  "key": "prev_task_ids",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "前置任务 id，逗号分隔，决定 DAG 依赖"
                },
                {
                  "key": "description",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "描述，可空"
                },
                {
                  "key": "retry_count",
                  "value": "3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "接口值！1=不重试 2=重试1次 3=重试5次 4=一直重试（库里存的是 0/1/5/-1）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "over_time",
                  "value": "30",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "超时秒数"
                },
                {
                  "key": "priority",
                  "value": "6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "6=P4 7=P3 8=P2 9=P1 10=P0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "server_tag",
                  "value": "ALL",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "资源标签，ALL 表示不限"
                },
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "处理器类型，取自 task.proc_type：6=docker"
                },
                {
                  "key": "version_id",
                  "value": "27",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "绑定的处理器版本，0=当前版本"
                },
                {
                  "key": "use_processor",
                  "value": "1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "是否使用处理器包"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 执行任务",
      "description": "这一组全部有真实副作用：会往 k8s 提交或中断作业。run_time 统一用 {{run_time_now}}（当前小时）。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 执行单个任务",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/run_one_task/",
            "description": "有真实副作用：会往 k8s 提交 job，不是空跑。\n\ntask_id_list 逗号分隔可一次跑多个，例如 142,143；要么全成功要么全失败。\nrun_time 是 12 位 YYYYMMDDHHMM（精确到分钟），这里用 {{run_time_now}}，\n由集合前置脚本按当前时间算——平台记录的 run_time 就是到分钟的，形如 202609241438。\n服务端也支持单值 / 逗号多值 / 区间 2026092410-2026092510，以及天级和小时级后缀。\n\n返回 {\"status\":0,\"msg\":\"OK\"}。提交完用 4.1 轮询状态。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "task_id_list",
                  "value": "{{task_id}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "逗号分隔，可多个"
                },
                {
                  "key": "run_time",
                  "value": "{{run_time_now}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "12 位 YYYYMMDDHHMM，默认当前分钟"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 执行整条流程",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/run_one_pipeline/",
            "description": "有真实副作用：会把流程里所有任务按 DAG 顺序提交。\n\n参数是 pl_id_list（不是 task_id_list），同样支持逗号分隔多个流程。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "pl_id_list",
                  "value": "{{pipeline_id}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "流程 id，逗号分隔可多个"
                },
                {
                  "key": "run_time",
                  "value": "{{run_time_now}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "12 位 YYYYMMDDHHMM，默认当前分钟"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 执行任务及其所有下游",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/run_task_with_all_successors/",
            "description": "有真实副作用：除了指定任务，还会把它所有下游任务一起提交。\n\n适合「从中间某个节点重跑」的场景，注意下游范围可能比预期大。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "task_id_list",
                  "value": "{{task_id}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "逗号分隔，可多个"
                },
                {
                  "key": "run_time",
                  "value": "{{run_time_now}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "12 位 YYYYMMDDHHMM，默认当前分钟"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 批量执行（每个任务各自的 run_time）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/run_some_task/",
            "description": "有真实副作用。\n\ntasklist 和 runtimelist 按下标一一对应，逐个提交，可以让不同任务落在不同 run_time 上。\n两个列表长度必须一致：tasklist=142,143&runtimelist=202609240000,202609250000。",
            "body": {
