    },
    {
      "name": "04 查询执行状态",
      "description": "执行完回这里看结果。4.1 是轮询主力，4.2 是分页历史。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 某次运行的全图（轮询用）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "simplejwt 只认 Bearer。写成 'JWT <token>' 会 401 Authentication credentials were not provided。"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pipeline/get_graph/",
            "description": "查执行状态的主力接口：给一个 run_time，返回这次运行里每个节点的状态。\n\n参数名是 pipe_id，不是 pipeline_id，写错了会静默取到 None。\n\n状态码（horae/tools_util.py TaskState）：\n  0 等待中 / 1 运行中 / 2 执行成功 / 3 执行失败 / 4 已超时\n  5 已就绪(等待下发) / 6 被用户停止 / 7 前置任务失败\n终态是 2/3/4/6/7；整条流程成功 = 所有节点 status==2。\n\n响应脚本会把状态翻成中文打到 Console，并判断是否已到终态。\n没到终态就等几秒再点一次 Send —— 这就是轮询。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "pipe_id",
                  "value": "{{pipeline_id}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "流程 id。参数名是 pipe_id，不是 pipeline_id"
                },
                {
                  "key": "run_time",
                  "value": "{{run_time}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "要查的那次运行，12 位 YYYYMMDDHHMM"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// 把状态码翻成中文，并判断是否已到终态",
                  "var MAP = {0:'等待中', 1:'运行中', 2:'执行成功', 3:'执行失败',",
                  "           4:'已超时', 5:'已就绪(等待下发)', 6:'被用户停止', 7:'前置任务失败'};",
                  "var TERMINAL = [2, 3, 4, 6, 7];",
                  "",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json().res || [];",
                  "    if (!res.length) {",
                  "        console.log('该 run_time 暂无运行记录（还没调度到，或时间戳写错了）');",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        var pending = 0;",
                  "        res.forEach(function (it) {",
                  "            if (TERMINAL.indexOf(it.status) < 0) { pending++; }",
                  "            console.log('task ' + it.task_id + ' ' + (it.task_name || '') +",
                  "                        ' -> ' + (MAP[it.status] || it.status));",
                  "        });",
                  "        if (pending === 0) {",
                  "            var ok = res.every(function (it) { return it.status === 2; });",
                  "            console.log(ok ? '全部成功' : '已结束，但有节点失败/被停止');",
                  "        } else {",
                  "            console.log('还有 ' + pending + ' 个节点未到终态，等几秒再点一次 Send');",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.log('解析失败: ' + e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
